'''Benjamin Kirby "Ben" Tennyson,''' also known as '''Ben 23''', is an alternate version of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]]; a hero and a former mogul in [[Dimension 23]] who first appeared in ''[[Store 23]]''.

==Appearance==
Ben 23 chooses to reflect his amount of money by wearing lots of gold and accessories. He wears a black waistcoat with blue pockets over his blue shirt (revealing his short sleeves), a blue tie, earrings, blue pants, and a medallion in the shape of his [[Hero Watch|Omnitrix]] ("Hero Watch" as Ben 23 calls it). He has the Omnitrix on his left wrist and a blue bracelet on his right wrist, he also has a gold ring on the index finger of his right hand. Unlike Ben Prime, Ben 23 has blue eyes instead of green and his hair is longer, covering his left eye. He also wears a Bluetooth on his right ear, which he uses to talk to his agent, and carries around a smartphone for texting.

Because of his age (13 years-old), Ben has the physical build of a pre-teen boy, resembling his Prime-Counterpart's 16 years-old body, but still with child-like characteristics like a lesser stature, a thinner body and a rounded chin (like 10-11 years-old Ben-Prime).

On an advertisement billboard featured in ''[[And Then There Was Ben]]'', he is wearing a black shirt, a blue jacket, and a blue backwards cap.

